# Reel 57 — «Скільки заробляє RUTA»

134.083 s plate (4023 frames, cut.py + work/r57/cut-fix.json, no closeups) · Google × Excalidraw (STYLE.md §0b),
near → near → near → OVER → near → near → near → OVER → near. `build.py` is the source of truth.

## The chain

The one object is **her guess**: плюс / мінус / нуль chips at the start, the scale on board 2 that
answers it, the same chips (мінус circled) in the CTA. Only numbers she says: 70, 100, 35, 20, 55,
15–20 (AI, whole life of the app), 1,50 per user, ≈70 costs, 60 earned.

